ClickHouseSink/default records clickhouse.kuberecord-quickstart.svc:9000.

The profile records 127.0.0.1:19000 instead, as --addr asked.

Database kuberecord is the sink's own; the user is kuberecord_ro, as --username asked.
Its own credential is Secret kuberecord-system/clickhouse-credentials, key "password".
The profile does not copy it: it reads the file /run/ch.
Put a read-only ClickHouse user's password there rather than the operator's,
which is a credential that can write to the audit trail. See
docs/CLI.md#the-read-only-clickhouse-user
